<section class="container page-section"><div class="feature-card"><h1 class="h2"><?php echo $purpose === 'verify' ? 'Konfirmasi email' : 'Pulihkan kata sandi'; ?></h1><?php if ($error): ?><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert"><?php echo html_escape($error); ?></div><?php endif; ?>
	<?php if ($purpose === 'verify' && ! $current_user): ?><p>Masuk ke akun yang meminta verifikasi terlebih dahulu, lalu buka kembali tautan pada email atau tempel kode. Membuka tautan saja tidak mengubah akun.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="<?php echo site_url('masuk'); ?>">Masuk</a>
	<?php else: ?><p>Tautan tidak dipakai otomatis. Tinjau akun/formulir lalu tekan tombol konfirmasi. Jika kode tidak terisi, salin kode sekali pakai dari email.</p><?php echo form_open($purpose === 'verify' ? 'akun/verifikasi' : 'pulihkan-sandi'); ?><label class="form-label" for="account-token">Kode sekali pakai</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="account-token" name="token" type="password" minlength="64" maxlength="64" pattern="[a-f0-9]{64}" autocomplete="off" required data-account-token><?php if ($purpose === 'reset'): ?><p>Minimal 12 karakter (Superadmin minimal 16), maksimal 72 byte. Semua sesi lama akan berakhir setelah kata sandi diganti.</p><label class="form-label" for="new-password">Kata sandi baru</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="new-password" name="password" type="password" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required><label class="form-label" for="confirm-password">Ulangi kata sandi baru</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="confirm-password" name="password_confirm" type="password" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required><?php endif; ?><button class="btn btn-primary"><?php echo $purpose === 'verify' ? 'Konfirmasi email akun saya' : 'Simpan kata sandi baru'; ?></button><?php echo form_close(); ?><?php endif; ?></div></section>
<script src="<?php echo base_url('assets/js/account-token.js'); ?>" defer></script>
